flowchart TD
    A[Customer starts checkout] --> B[Authenticate customer]
    B --> C[Load order and amount from trusted server data]
    C --> D{Choose payment method}
    D -->|Visa card| E[Create hosted checkout session]
    D -->|Cash App Pay| E
    E --> F[Redirect customer to payment adapter]
    F --> G{Customer completes payment?}
    G -->|No| H[Return to checkout or cancel]
    G -->|Yes| I[Payment provider sends webhook]
    I --> J{Signature valid and event new?}
    J -->|No| K[Reject event; do not fulfill order]
    J -->|Yes| L[Update order from verified payment event]
    L --> M[Fulfill order]
